1. e4 c6 2. Nc3 d5 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. e5 { Kicks the knight at once: it has nowhere comfortable to go. } 4... Ne4 5. Nxe4 { Trades the knight, so Black has to recapture. } 5... dxe4 6. Ng5 { Attacks the pawn on e4 and develops. } 6... Bf5 7. Qe2 { Piles up on e4 so the pawn will fall. } *
